{"seq":2,"slug":"retry-fallback","title":"重试与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-error-handling/resilience/retry-fallback","wordCount":1793,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试与回退\">重试与回退</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/error-types\">错误类型</a>把网络错误分成了瞬时、客户端、服务端三档,其中瞬时错误——一次网络抖动、一次偶发超时——往往重试一下就好。重试是前端韧性里性价比最高的一招,因为它能用几行代码自动消化掉相当比例的失败,用户甚至感觉不到出过错。但重试也是最容易写错、写错后果最严重的一招:不当的重试会放大故障、把本就摇摇欲坠的后端彻底压垮。这一节讲怎么把重试做成解药而不是毒药。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重试的全部学问,在于回答四个问题:这个错误该不该重试、隔多久重试、最多重几次、什么时候彻底放弃改为回退。把这四个问题串起来,就是一套完整的重试策略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[请求失败] --&gt; B{错误可重试吗?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 如 4xx| C[立即回退/提示]&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 如超时/5xx| D{未达最大次数?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[放弃, 触发降级]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[按退避算法等待]&#10;  F --&gt; G[加入随机抖动]&#10;  G --&gt; H[重试]&#10;  H --&gt; A&#10;  E --&gt; I[优雅降级 / 用户提示]\">flowchart TD\n  A[请求失败] --&gt; B{错误可重试吗?}\n  B --&gt;|否, 如 4xx| C[立即回退/提示]\n  B --&gt;|是, 如超时/5xx| D{未达最大次数?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[放弃, 触发降级]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[按退避算法等待]\n  F --&gt; G[加入随机抖动]\n  G --&gt; H[重试]\n  H --&gt; A\n  E --&gt; I[优雅降级 / 用户提示]</pre><p>这张图里两个判断节点是重试安全的关键:第一个「该不该重试」拦掉了对 4xx 这类重试无意义错误的浪费,第二个「最大次数」和退避+抖动一起,防止重试本身变成对后端的攻击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该不该重试-幂等性是前提\">该不该重试:幂等性是前提</h2><p>不是所有失败都该重试,这条线划错会出大事。两个判断维度:错误类型和操作幂等性。</p>\n<p>错误类型上,瞬时错误(超时、502/503、网络断开)值得重试;客户端错误(400/401/403/404)重试毫无意义——参数错了重试一百次还是错,权限不够重试也变不出权限。幂等性更要命:一个 <code>GET</code> 请求重试是安全的,但一个「创建订单」的 <code>POST</code> 盲目重试,可能让用户下两次单、付两次钱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>可重试?</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GET 查询</td>\n<td>安全重试</td>\n<td>天然幂等,重读无副作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PUT / DELETE</td>\n<td>通常安全</td>\n<td>设计上幂等,重复执行结果一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POST 创建</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>非幂等,重试可能重复创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带幂等键的 POST</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>服务端用幂等键去重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对非幂等的写操作,正确做法是和后端约定幂等键(idempotency key):客户端为每次操作生成一个唯一 ID 随请求带上,服务端据此去重,这样即便重试也只会执行一次。没有幂等保证就盲目重试写操作,是重试反模式里最危险的一种,详见<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指数退避与抖动\">指数退避与抖动</h2><p>确定可以重试后,「隔多久重」决定了重试是缓解故障还是加剧故障。固定间隔重试是最糟的选择:如果是后端过载导致的失败,所有客户端会以相同节奏同时重试,形成一波又一波的「重试风暴」,把刚要缓过来的后端再次打垮。</p>\n<p>正解是指数退避(exponential backoff)加随机抖动(jitter)。退避让每次重试的等待时间指数增长,给后端喘息的空间;抖动则给等待时间加上随机偏移,打散客户端的重试节奏。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试,基础延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>,则等待时间约为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(b \\cdot 2^{n}, t_{max}) \\cdot (1 + \\text{rand}(-J, J))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是封顶延迟,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动幅度。抖动的重要性常被低估:根据 AWS 的工程实践,没有抖动时所有客户端会在同一时刻同步重试,而加入抖动后,重试请求被均匀打散,显著降低了瞬时峰值(参见 <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/builders-library/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter/\">AWS Builders&#39; Library 关于超时、重试与抖动退避的文章</a>)。一个实务取值是基础延迟几百毫秒、上限几秒、抖动 ±50%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function retry(fn, { max = 3, base = 300, cap = 5000 } = {}) {&#10;  for (let n = 0; ; n++) {&#10;    try {&#10;      return await fn();&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      if (n &gt;= max || !isRetriable(err)) throw err;&#10;      const backoff = Math.min(base * 2 ** n, cap);&#10;      const jitter = backoff * (Math.random() - 0.5); // ±50%&#10;      await new Promise((r) =&gt; setTimeout(r, backoff + jitter));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function retry(fn, { max = 3, base = 300, cap = 5000 } = {}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let n = 0; ; n++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return await fn();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (n >= max || !isRetriable(err)) throw err;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const backoff = Math.min(base * 2 ** n, cap);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const jitter = backoff * (Math.random() - 0.5); // ±50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, backoff + jitter));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里的 <code>fn</code> 应该自带超时(见<a href=\"async-promise-errors\">异步与 Promise 错误</a>的 <code>AbortController</code>),否则一个挂起的请求会让重试永远等不到触发时机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断-从重试升级到回退\">熔断:从重试升级到回退</h2><p>重试解决的是「偶发失败」,但如果一个服务持续挂掉,继续重试就是在做无用功——既拖慢用户,又持续加压。这时需要从重试「升级」到熔断(circuit breaker):识别到某个依赖已经持续失败,就在一段时间内直接快速失败、不再发起请求,把资源省下来直接走<a href=\"graceful-degradation\">优雅降级</a>。</p>\n<p>熔断器有三个状态:闭合(正常放行)、打开(快速失败,不调用)、半开(隔一段时间放一个试探请求,成功则恢复闭合,失败则继续打开)。它和重试是分工关系——重试处理单次请求的瞬时抖动,熔断处理整个依赖的持续故障,两者叠加才完整:先重试几次,若失败模式表明是持续性故障,则熔断并降级。这套「重试 + 熔断 + 降级」的组合,在 2026 年已是前端面对多依赖架构的标准韧性配置。熔断打开期间给用户看什么,交给<a href=\"../practice/user-facing-errors\">面向用户的错误</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谁来重试-层级的选择\">谁来重试:层级的选择</h2><p>重试可以发生在好几个层级,放错层级会让同一个请求被重试好几遍,把次数悄悄翻倍。三个常见层级各有定位。</p>\n<p>最底层是 HTTP 客户端层(如给 fetch 封一层、或用 axios 的拦截器):适合放「对所有请求一视同仁的通用瞬时重试」,统一管理退避和幂等判断,是大多数重试逻辑应该待的地方。中间是数据请求库层(如 TanStack Query 这类):它内置了重试和退避,还把重试和缓存、失效、后台刷新整合在一起,对读操作尤其顺手,2026 年是 React 应用的主流选择。最上层是业务代码层:只在「这次重试有特殊业务语义」时才手写,比如某个关键操作要给用户看「正在重试 2/3」的进度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>适合重试什么</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP 客户端层</td>\n<td>通用瞬时错误,统一退避</td>\n<td>对非幂等操作要谨慎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据请求库层</td>\n<td>读操作,整合缓存</td>\n<td>默认配置可能过于激进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务代码层</td>\n<td>有特殊语义的关键操作</td>\n<td>容易和下层重叠成双重重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最危险的反模式是多层同时开了重试却互不知情:客户端层重试 3 次、请求库层又重试 3 次,一个失败的请求实际打了 9 次,退避也被打乱。原则是:在一个层级集中管理重试,其余层级关掉,避免重试叠加。这类「无意中放大请求」的坑,在<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误用</a>里还会再提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重试是性价比最高的韧性手段,但写错会引发重试风暴、压垮后端,必须谨慎。</li>\n<li>重试前先判断两件事:错误是否瞬时(4xx 不重试)、操作是否幂等(非幂等写操作需幂等键才能安全重试)。</li>\n<li>用指数退避 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(b \\cdot 2^n, t_{max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给后端喘息,再加 ±50% 抖动打散客户端节奏,避免同步重试。</li>\n<li>重试的 <code>fn</code> 必须自带超时,否则挂起的请求会让重试无从触发。</li>\n<li>持续故障应从重试升级到熔断:闭合/打开/半开三态,打开期间快速失败并走<a href=\"graceful-degradation\">优雅降级</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重试与回退","id":"重试与回退"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"该不该重试:幂等性是前提","id":"该不该重试-幂等性是前提"},{"level":2,"text":"指数退避与抖动","id":"指数退避与抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断:从重试升级到回退","id":"熔断-从重试升级到回退"},{"level":2,"text":"谁来重试:层级的选择","id":"谁来重试-层级的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优雅降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-error-handling/resilience/graceful-degradation"},"next":{"title":"离线与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-error-handling/resilience/offline-recovery"}}